  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Tradition is okay, but sometimes you just want to do something different!”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dragon pact kineticist or elemental ascetic 1st</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the following form infusion; this infusion can be applied to your kinetic blast regardless of the normal limitations of your archetype:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ranged Blast</strong><br>\n<strong>Element(s)</strong> universal; <strong>Type</strong> form infusion; <strong>Level</strong> 1; <strong>Burn</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Associated Blasts</strong> any<br>\n<strong>Saving Throw</strong> none</p>\n<p>You have learned to use your elemental weapon as a ranged attack. You may make a ranged attack with your kinetic blast with a range of up to 30 feet.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc58\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
